{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Favourite retro games from the era of 8/16-bit consoles or want to try something like this for the first time? Welcome to the world of &quot;Owl&quot;, an exciting adventure in the world of an alternate Wild West. Explore new regions, search for secrets and of course feed lead to your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic action from the NES/SNES era  with modern features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several unlockable heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable costumes, skills and weapon enhancements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique game experience without a UI - immerse yourself in the story and action so nothing distracts you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses and mini-bosses with multiple phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playthroughs of unlocked levels<br><br>and much more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459400?t=1756331157","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459400?t=1756331157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459400/eea82f02eef811a229a55432cb857f673a5241d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756331157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459400/eea82f02eef811a229a55432cb857f673a5241d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756331157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description"